1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,000
Mmm...

2
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,900
Time moves on

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Memories stay

4
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,500
Memories ticking like a clock on the wall

5
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,820
Waiting for the echoes in an empty hall

6
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,160
Shadows in the corners of my restless mind

7
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,400
Tracing all the pieces that we left behind

8
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,720
I held it all together just to watch it bend

9
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,940
Walking down the road wondering where it ends

10
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,200
Suni aati woh vaade raaste

11
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,950
Dhoondhe tujhko har mod pe

12
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:47,300
Haathon se fisla jo woh sama tha

13
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:52,200
Sirf yaadon ka ab ek jahaan tha

14
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:53,840
Woh lamhe

15
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,860
Woh baatein

16
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,720
Koi na jaane

17
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,440
I kept inside

18
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:00,560
Thi kaisi raatein

19
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,400
Barsatein

20
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,060
In the end

21
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:06,700
All the shadows fade to grey

22
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:11,550
Par woh lamhe kabhi na jayenge

23
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,700
Staring at the rain coming down outside

24
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:25,030
Nowhere left to run, nowhere left to hide

25
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:27,280
Every promise whispered, swept into the dust

26
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:29,600
Nothing left to lean on, nothing left to trust

27
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:32,500
Aag ki lehron sa dard ye uthta hai

28
00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:35,000
Every ticking second pulls the walls right in

29
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:37,760
Khamosh labon par naam tera rukta hai

30
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:41,250
How do I forget where the fractures begin

31
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:02,600
Woh lamhe

32
00:02:02,860 --> 00:02:04,800
It slips away

33
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:07,080
Thi kaisi raatein

34
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:10,700
Fading into the rain
